{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "thundercoil-operation-observation-handbook",
  "name": "Thundercoil Operation Observation Handbook",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Thundercoil_Operation_Observation_Handbook",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-03T10:35:34.700Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This manual (11th Edition) was compiled at ██████████. It provides supervisors with status assessments and assistance methods for our core staff member, \"thundercoil.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b2f9b6685c427820"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Basic Information"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Normally, thundercoil has a soft physique and 30% reflectivity. He wears custom headphones on duty. You can't tell his mood just by looking at his face."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "According to thundercoil, his peak physical state is achieved by coiling clockwise around the tower tip two and a half times and hugging the spire (hereafter the \"Ideal State\")."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e0a71815d7150598"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Working Hours: 0700 to 0100 next day."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Rest: Four system hours total, flexible."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Wishpower Auto-Supply System Charging: 1130, 1830, and 0030 daily (variable for late-night programs)."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "※ If he forgets, just use the internal broadcast and point the searchlights at the rooftop."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-57eb59c8d4003cab"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Quick Response Guide"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I. Station TV Observation"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Static Screen"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Check if thundercoil is at his station."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(During breaks) Verify the status of the Wishpower Auto-Supply System."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-75cdad1e345b4c26"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Lag or Dropped Frames"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Go outside and check if thundercoil's tail is obscuring his head."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Check if Seafeld Channel 3 is airing \"Thunder Dragon Adventures\" and remind thundercoil to stay focused on work."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7bc915a3aa693ba6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Signal Bleed"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Check if thundercoil's claws are overgrown. Use the idle crane at the neighboring site to trim them."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(If inapplicable) Ask thundercoil if he stayed up late stargazing. Adjust his rest time accordingly and record the pay deduction."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-708c0ab398023601"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Non-Program Content Airing"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Notify thundercoil over the intercom and help locate signal hijackers (likely hackers). Thundercoil will usually ████████ in response."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In case of casualties, contact the Department of Aberration Defense and try to get the event ruled as self-defense."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-62639db112ab442c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "II. Direct Observation"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Appears \"Depressed\" or Shows \"Rage\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "No action required. Thundercoil's facial structure differs from typical imagenates. This is just how he looks when he's \"relaxed.\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e90272de696b16bb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Dull Skin or Low Reflectivity"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Check if the supply of \"Yellow Ducky Wish-crackers (Thundercoil Special Edition)\" has dropped below five tons."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1f51fe960a6418f9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Visibly Happy, Laughing, and Frantically Dancing"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "█████████████████████████████████████"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sound the alarm immediately and evacuate all personnel from the tower."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1b139995f22aac3b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Wearing a Mask"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Head to B3 Archives in the station. Locate the document \"Emergency Protocol: Thundercoil as a Supplicant\" on shelf 15-3 (disguised as an advanced math textbook). The quantum lock code is \"5-φ-3-7.\" (Note: Three failed attempts will trigger self-destruction)."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e6dcf01125fb6797"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "III. Other Scenarios"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Brief, Isolated Seismic Activity"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Check if thundercoil fell off while napping. Issue the standard public announcement."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5759d0ebe2fd2630"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. TV Footage Playing Directly in Your Mind"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Take that aluminum pot off your head."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e95c0bc32f19b1c3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Note 1: If thundercoil shows no anomalies but the signal still fluctuates, check the Planarcadia Administration announcements for Wishpower turbulence."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2688702b6505a14c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Note 2: Only one thundercoil is stationed at Seafeld TV. If you observe more than one simultaneously, check today's visitor logs for specific Masked Fools."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9999c3b755bd436e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For special cases, contact the reception to reach Director Fulwish or the Department of Aberration Defense."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-545a4f505e55ddb3"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
